1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,342
Who is buzzing in the garden? Can you guess?

2
00:00:03,742 --> 00:00:05,945
It goes buzz buzz and makes yummy honey!

3
00:00:09,745 --> 00:00:10,981
Yes! It's a bee!

4
00:00:11,481 --> 00:00:12,886
Say it with me! Bee!

5
00:00:16,186 --> 00:00:17,249
Who is this shadow?

6
00:00:17,649 --> 00:00:20,053
It is tiny and red with little black spots!

7
00:00:23,853 --> 00:00:25,336
Yes! It's a ladybug!

8
00:00:25,836 --> 00:00:27,559
Say it with me! Ladybug!

9
00:00:30,859 --> 00:00:31,923
Who is this shadow?

10
00:00:32,323 --> 00:00:34,534
It is very small and very, very strong!

11
00:00:38,334 --> 00:00:39,590
Yes! It's an ant!

12
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:41,469
Say it with me! Ant!

13
00:00:44,769 --> 00:00:46,519
Last one! Who is this shadow?

14
00:00:46,919 --> 00:00:50,392
It has big, pretty wings and flies from flower to flower!

15
00:00:54,192 --> 00:00:55,698
Yes! It's a butterfly!

16
00:00:56,198 --> 00:00:57,956
Say it with me! Butterfly!

17
00:01:00,956 --> 00:01:03,452
Wow! You got them all! How many did you guess?

